msgstr "Ihanda ang isang Slurm login node bilang workflow host na may mga Python environment, Prefect login, at IBM Quantum credential para sa QRMI"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
