# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up QCSC-Prefect on a Slurm cluster {#set-up-qcsc-prefect-on-a-slurm-cluster}"
msgstr "I-set up ang QCSC-Prefect sa isang Slurm cluster {#set-up-qcsc-prefect-on-a-slurm-cluster}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide prepares the login node of a Slurm cluster as the workflow host of qcsc-prefect.\n"
"The qcsc-prefect SQD tutorial starts from the result of this guide.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inihahanda ng gabay na ito ang login node ng isang Slurm cluster bilang workflow host ng qcsc-prefect.\n"
"Ang qcsc-prefect SQD tutorial ay nagsisimula sa resulta ng gabay na ito.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After you complete this guide, you have the following items:\n"
msgstr "Pagkatapos mong kumpletuhin ang gabay na ito, mayroon ka ng mga sumusunod na item:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Item | Where | Contents |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-host` | Login node, the workflow host | Prefect, the qcsc-prefect packages, and the `qcsc-qrmi` command |\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-node` | Compute nodes, inside Slurm jobs | The QRMI worker: QRMI with its `task_runner` command, and `qcsc-prefect-qiskit` |\n"
"| `qrmi-runtime` | Prefect | The block that names your IBM Quantum&reg; instance and QPU |\n"
"| `qrmi_config.json` | Login node and compute nodes | Your IBM Cloud&reg; API key, instances, and backends for QRMI |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Item | Saan | Nilalaman |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-host` | Login node, ang workflow host | Prefect, ang mga qcsc-prefect package, at ang command na `qcsc-qrmi` |\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-node` | Mga compute node, sa loob ng mga Slurm job | Ang QRMI worker: QRMI kasama ang command nitong `task_runner`, at `qcsc-prefect-qiskit` |\n"
"| `qrmi-runtime` | Prefect | Ang block na nagpapangalan sa iyong IBM Quantum&reg; instance at QPU |\n"
"| `qrmi_config.json` | Login node at mga compute node | Ang iyong IBM Cloud&reg; API key, mga instance, at mga backend para sa QRMI |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run each command in a terminal on the login node, unless the step says otherwise.\n"
msgstr "Patakbuhin ang bawat command sa isang terminal sa login node, maliban kung iba ang sinasabi ng hakbang.\n"

