"Isang Slurm cluster na may OpenMPI, PMIx, at ang QRMI SPANK plugin, na ini-install ng\n"
"administrator ng cluster. Inilalarawan ng mga sumusunod na gabay ang mga component na ito:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Quantum resource management interface (QRMI)](/guides/qrmi)\n"
msgstr "[Quantum resource management interface (QRMI)](/guides/qrmi)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[SPANK plugin for QRMI](/guides/slurm-plugin)\n"
msgstr "[SPANK plugin para sa QRMI](/guides/slurm-plugin)\n"

# doq: translated after #1094 review 2026-11-21
