"Isang home directory at isang work directory na nakikita ng login node at ng mga compute node sa\n"
"parehong absolute path\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Outbound HTTPS access to GitHub, PyPI, IBM Quantum, and Prefect Cloud from the login\n"
"node, and to IBM Quantum from the compute nodes\n"
msgstr ""
"Outbound HTTPS access sa GitHub, PyPI, IBM Quantum, at Prefect Cloud mula sa login\n"
"node, at sa IBM Quantum mula sa mga compute node\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "An IBM Quantum Platform account with an IBM Cloud API key and at least one instance\n"
msgstr "Isang IBM Quantum Platform account na may IBM Cloud API key at kahit isang instance\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A Prefect Cloud account, or a Prefect server that you host\n"
msgstr "Isang Prefect Cloud account, o isang Prefect server na ikaw ang nagho-host\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Git, C and C++ compilers, CMake, BLAS, LAPACK, and MPI on the cluster, for the solver\n"
"builds of the tutorial\n"
msgstr ""
"Git, mga C at C++ compiler, CMake, BLAS, LAPACK, at MPI sa cluster, para sa mga solver\n"
"build ng tutorial\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The examples use the Slurm partition `normal` and the compute nodes `c1` and `c2`. Replace\n"
"them with the names of your cluster.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ginagamit ng mga halimbawa ang Slurm partition na `normal` at ang mga compute node na `c1` at `c2`. Palitan\n"
"ang mga ito ng mga pangalan sa cluster mo.\n"

