#, no-wrap
msgid "</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Log in to the login node {#step-1-log-in-to-the-login-node}"
msgstr "Hakbang 1: Mag-log in sa login node {#step-1-log-in-to-the-login-node}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Install uv {#step-2-install-uv}"
msgstr "Hakbang 2: I-install ang uv {#step-2-install-uv}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) package manager, and check the installation:\n"
msgstr "I-install ang [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) package manager, at suriin ang installation:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Set the paths and create the work directory {#step-3-set-the-paths-and-create-the-work-directory}"
msgstr "Hakbang 3: Itakda ang mga path at gawin ang work directory {#step-3-set-the-paths-and-create-the-work-directory}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide and the tutorials use two environment variables:\n"
msgstr "Gumagamit ang gabay na ito at ang mga tutorial ng dalawang environment variable:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Variable | Example | Purpose |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `QCSC_PREFECT` | `$HOME/qcsc-prefect` | The qcsc-prefect checkout |\n"
"| `QCSC_WORK_DIR` | `/shared/work/qcsc-prefect` | The work directory of the solver jobs and the QRMI jobs |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Variable | Halimbawa | Layunin |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `QCSC_PREFECT` | `$HOME/qcsc-prefect` | Ang qcsc-prefect checkout |\n"
"| `QCSC_WORK_DIR` | `/shared/work/qcsc-prefect` | Ang work directory ng mga solver job at mga QRMI job |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Both paths must be on storage that the compute nodes see at the same absolute path. If\n"
"your cluster has no `/shared` directory, choose another shared path.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dapat nasa storage ang parehong path na nakikita ng mga compute node sa parehong absolute path. Kung\n"
"walang `/shared` directory ang cluster mo, pumili ng ibang shared path.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set the variables, and create the work directory. Set the variables again in every new\n"
"shell before you follow a tutorial:\n"
msgstr ""
"Itakda ang mga variable, at gawin ang work directory. Itakda muli ang mga variable sa bawat bagong\n"
"shell bago ka sumunod sa isang tutorial:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To set the variables in every new shell automatically, add them to `~/.bashrc`:\n"
msgstr "Para awtomatikong itakda ang mga variable sa bawat bagong shell, idagdag ang mga ito sa `~/.bashrc`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Clone qcsc-prefect {#step-4-clone-qcsc-prefect}"
msgstr "Hakbang 4: I-clone ang qcsc-prefect {#step-4-clone-qcsc-prefect}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the repository, and check out a release tag, for example `v0.3.1`:\n"
msgstr "I-clone ang repository, at i-check out ang isang release tag, halimbawa `v0.3.1`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 5: Create the workflow environment {#step-5-create-the-workflow-environment}"
msgstr "Hakbang 5: Gawin ang workflow environment {#step-5-create-the-workflow-environment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the workflow environment with Python 3.12, and activate it:\n"
msgstr "Gawin ang workflow environment gamit ang Python 3.12, at i-activate ito:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the qcsc-prefect packages. The `--no-deps` option keeps the exact version pins\n"
"between the packages of the checkout. The tutorial installs the workflow itself:\n"
msgstr ""
"I-install ang mga qcsc-prefect package. Pinapanatili ng opsyong `--no-deps` ang eksaktong version pin\n"
"sa pagitan ng mga package ng checkout. Ini-install ng tutorial ang workflow mismo:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the commands are available:\n"
msgstr "Tiyaking available ang mga command:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate `~/venv/qcsc-host` in every new shell on the login node.\n"
msgstr "I-activate ang `~/venv/qcsc-host` sa bawat bagong shell sa login node.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 6: Log in to Prefect {#step-6-log-in-to-prefect}"
msgstr "Hakbang 6: Mag-log in sa Prefect {#step-6-log-in-to-prefect}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Log in to Prefect Cloud. Choose **Paste an API key**, paste a Prefect Cloud API key, and\n"
"choose your workspace:\n"
msgstr ""
"Mag-log in sa Prefect Cloud. Piliin ang **Paste an API key**, i-paste ang Prefect Cloud API key, at\n"
"piliin ang iyong workspace:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the connection. The output shows `PREFECT_API_URL` and your workspace:\n"
msgstr "Tingnan ang koneksyon. Ipinapakita ng output ang `PREFECT_API_URL` at ang iyong workspace:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Optional: use your own Prefect server\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Opsyonal: gamitin ang sarili mong Prefect server\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Skip this note if you use Prefect Cloud. To use your own Prefect server instead of Prefect\n"
"Cloud, follow\n"
"[How to run and access a Prefect server on a Slurm login node](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/howto/howto_setup_prefect_server_slurm/),\n"
"and set the address of your server in place of `<server-host>`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Laktawan ang tala na ito kung gumagamit ka ng Prefect Cloud. Para gamitin ang sarili mong Prefect server sa halip na Prefect\n"
"Cloud, sundan ang\n"
"[How to run and access a Prefect server on a Slurm login node](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/howto/howto_setup_prefect_server_slurm/),\n"
"at itakda ang address ng server mo kapalit ng `<server-host>`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 7: Store the IBM Quantum credentials {#step-7-store-the-ibm-quantum-credentials}"
msgstr "Hakbang 7: I-store ang mga IBM Quantum credential {#step-7-store-the-ibm-quantum-credentials}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run `qcsc-qrmi login` after the Prefect login, because it saves the `qrmi-runtime` block:\n"
msgstr "Patakbuhin ang `qcsc-qrmi login` pagkatapos ng Prefect login, dahil sine-save nito ang `qrmi-runtime` block:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Answer the prompts:\n"
msgstr "Sagutin ang mga prompt:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Paste your IBM Cloud API key. The key is not shown.\n"
msgstr "I-paste ang IBM Cloud API key mo. Hindi ipinapakita ang key.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Press Enter to use all instances.\n"
msgstr "Pindutin ang Enter para gamitin ang lahat ng instance.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter the number of the default instance, `1` in the following example.\n"
msgstr "Ilagay ang numero ng default instance, `1` sa sumusunod na halimbawa.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Enter the number or the name of the default backend, `4` (`ibm_kingston`) in the\n"
"following example.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ilagay ang numero o pangalan ng default backend, `4` (`ibm_kingston`) sa\n"
"sumusunod na halimbawa.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The command also prints a note about the compute nodes and `[qrmi]` lines for\n"
"`sqd_blocks.toml`, which the example omits (`...`). You do not need the `[qrmi]` lines,\n"
"because the workflow reads the instance and the backend from the `qrmi-runtime` block.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nagpi-print din ang command ng tala tungkol sa mga compute node at mga linyang `[qrmi]` para sa\n"
"`sqd_blocks.toml`, na nilaktawan ng halimbawa (`...`). Hindi mo kailangan ang mga linyang `[qrmi]`,\n"
"dahil binabasa ng workflow ang instance at ang backend mula sa `qrmi-runtime` block.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `qcsc-qrmi` command has the following subcommands:\n"
msgstr "Ang command na `qcsc-qrmi` ay may mga sumusunod na subcommand:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Command | Purpose |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi login` | Store the API key, the instances, and the backends, and save the block |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi refresh` | Find the instances and backends again with the stored key |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi list` | Print the instances and backends, without the key |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi check` | Check that the instance of the block can use its backend |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Command | Layunin |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi login` | I-store ang API key, ang mga instance, at ang mga backend, at i-save ang block |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi refresh` | Hanapin muli ang mga instance at backend gamit ang naka-store na key |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi list` | I-print ang mga instance at backend, nang walang key |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi check` | Tiyaking magagamit ng instance ng block ang backend nito |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the file on the compute nodes {#install-the-file-on-the-compute-nodes}"
msgstr "I-install ang file sa mga compute node {#install-the-file-on-the-compute-nodes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The SPANK plugin reads `qrmi_config.json` on each compute node, from the path in\n"
"`plugstack.conf`, often `/etc/slurm/qrmi_config.json`. Ask your cluster administrator to\n"
"install your `~/.qiskit/qrmi_config.json` at that path. Install it again after each\n"
"`qcsc-qrmi login` or `qcsc-qrmi refresh`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Binabasa ng SPANK plugin ang `qrmi_config.json` sa bawat compute node, mula sa path sa\n"
"`plugstack.conf`, kadalasan `/etc/slurm/qrmi_config.json`. Hilingin sa administrator ng cluster mo na\n"
"i-install ang `~/.qiskit/qrmi_config.json` mo sa path na iyon. I-install itong muli pagkatapos ng bawat\n"
"`qcsc-qrmi login` o `qcsc-qrmi refresh`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Keep **Session Mode** of the `qrmi-runtime` block at `batch`, because the SPANK plugin\n"
"acquires the QPU in batch mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"Panatilihin ang **Session Mode** ng `qrmi-runtime` block sa `batch`, dahil kinukuha ng SPANK plugin\n"
"ang QPU sa batch mode.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 8: Create the compute-node environment {#step-8-create-the-compute-node-environment}"
msgstr "Hakbang 8: Gumawa ng compute-node environment {#step-8-create-the-compute-node-environment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The QRMI worker runs on a compute node, in its own environment. Create it from the same\n"
"checkout. The `--python` option keeps `~/venv/qcsc-host` active:\n"
msgstr ""
"Tumatakbo ang QRMI worker sa isang compute node, sa sarili nitong environment. Gawin ito mula sa parehong\n"
"checkout. Pinapanatili ng opsyong `--python` na aktibo ang `~/venv/qcsc-host`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qrmi[ibm]` package provides the `task_runner` command. The tutorial adds the SQD\n"
"compilation hook to this environment, and uses `~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python` as the\n"
"`python_executable` of `sqd_blocks.toml`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ibinibigay ng package na `qrmi[ibm]` ang command na `task_runner`. Idinadagdag ng tutorial ang SQD\n"
"compilation hook sa environment na ito, at ginagamit ang `~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python` bilang\n"
"`python_executable` ng `sqd_blocks.toml`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 9: Verify the setup {#step-9-verify-the-setup}"
msgstr "Hakbang 9: I-verify ang setup {#step-9-verify-the-setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the `qrmi-runtime` block exists:\n"
msgstr "Tiyaking umiiral ang `qrmi-runtime` block:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the stored instances and backends. The command never prints the key:\n"
msgstr "Tingnan ang mga naka-store na instance at backend. Hindi kailanman ipi-print ng command ang key:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the default instance can use the default backend:\n"
msgstr "Tiyaking magagamit ng default instance ang default backend:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that Slurm runs a job on both compute nodes, also with PMIx:\n"
msgstr "Tiyaking nagpapatakbo ang Slurm ng job sa dalawang compute node, kasama rin sa PMIx:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Check the compute-node environment and the work directory on a compute node. The first\n"
"command prints nothing when the imports succeed:\n"
msgstr ""
"Tingnan ang compute-node environment at ang work directory sa isang compute node. Walang ipi-print\n"
"ang unang command kapag matagumpay ang mga import:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga rekomendasyon\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read [Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/)\n"
"to choose the nodes, ranks, and threads of the solver jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Basahin ang [Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/)\n"
"para piliin ang mga node, rank, at thread ng mga solver job.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read the [SQD workflow README](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect/tree/main/algorithms/open_loop/sqd)\n"
